  "reviewNotes": "PDF page8 and source front/back/top inspected. Source540000 triangles /27000084 bytes /height61.140301 mm. Free point[.75,.25] is clear, source floor25.519485 mm. The barrel/support reaches nativeY=-.17755, so the south blocker grows to0.50; west remains0.39. The cask axis is approximately[.99975575,-.01715,.01394]. Mid-body fit centreY=-8.708509,Z=52.429213; outer stave radius near8.4 mm. Longitudinal profiles and normal-aligned side faces place iron hoop boundaries at axis distances[-8.1125,-5.5375] and[4.0875,6.6625]; masks include .0275 mm edge allowance and radial limits7.3..9.2 mm. Body staves use longitudinal wrapped grain; inner lid boards use Z grain and end blocks keep cut-end variation. Source centre rays reach negative/positive lid faces nearX=-9.04/+6.97. The brass tap is isolated in front of the negative lid by projection and a bounded lower-face region, excluding the wooden outer rim. The jug bounds areX[-15.9782,-8.5355],Y[1.68825,9.53735],Z43.55..54.1340; its mouth stays open. All new parts compare with MT1-050 at .08 mm and project packed samples back to MT1-052. Original counter caps retain their measured upper bounds beneath supports. Check wood/iron boundaries around both hoops, rivets, support contacts, both lids, tap, empty jug mouth, original shelves, both tiers/candidates, metadata and shadow before publication. Coordinate correction: native +Y is editor north. The intended floor point is native[8.75,8.75], local[.75,.25]. The negative-Y counter/overhang occupies the southern local strip, not the northern strip. Native standPointsMM/blockersMM now drive conversion; the previous local[.75,.75] pointed onto the south counter. Final hoop mask follows independently fitted conical outer surfaces: left r=9.526622+.17455958*s, right r=9.293478-.15117268*s, thickness1.1 mm and outer allowance.045 mm. Protruding rivets above the support use separate measured ellipsoids. This excludes the wooden support outside the hoop radius. The positive band ends at s=6.66 mm, just inside its measured side plane, to exclude the stand contact in the simplified LOD.",
